 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. In 2026 so far, the middle of the grids got 7% of normal for February to March and 17% for March to April. Every grid had its driest year in 2022, with grid 22018 at 38% of normal. The preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 on grid 22018 is 148.7.</p>"}
